          "docs": "Gets a list of dimensions with their rates. The rates returned will always be the most recent versions of those rates."
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Upload a fee schedule (a collection of rates)",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://pre-api.joincandidhealth.com/api/fee-schedules/v3",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "Authorization",
                "value": ""
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Uploads a new fee schedule.\n\nEach rate may either be totally new as qualified by it's dimensions or a new version for an existing rate.\n\nIf adding a new version to an existing rate, the rate must be posted with the next version number (previous version + 1) or a EntityConflictError will\nbe returned.\n\nUse the dry run flag to discover already existing rates and to run validations.  If validations for any rate fail, no rates will\nbe saved to the system."
        },
